 "_doc": "Internal flows drawn between parts when a device is opened. from/to are part keys; '@body' is the device's own pipe or cable connection. medium picks the colour. rate (optional) ties the flow speed to a live reading of the device: {reading, max} -> speed in proportion to value/max (0..1.5); {reading, equals} -> full speed when the reading equals the value, else stopped; a boolean reading -> full or stopped. Without rate the flow runs at nominal speed. A part in fault stops the flows that touch it.",
